        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.travelmanitoba.com/directory/russell-historical-walking-tour/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Gordon Orr Memorial Museum sits in a former lumber company building, a municipally‑designated historic site.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://russellbinscarthlibrary.ca/community-information/local-history/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The last remaining row of standard country grain elevators, the Inglis Grain Elevators, stands beside an abandoned rail line in Russell.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://russellbinscarthlibrary.ca/community-information/local-history/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Russell lies about 15 km east of the Saskatchewan border and 340 km northwest of Winnipeg.",
